  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research: Bilateral and Regional Projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research (ACIAR) invests in research initiatives with partner countries in the Indo-Pacific region. The investment focuses on collaboratively identifying research priorities and brokering research partnerships that use science and technology to address these priorities. Our bilateral and regional research projects are managed through research themes structured around vital agricultural sectors, including farming, agroforestry, livestock and fisheries systems, and sustainable natural resource management. We also invest in research initiatives to generate economic and social benefits through policy, markets, institutions, value chains and social systems.</narrative>
  </description>
